# LOGBOOK — {{ project_name }}

What belongs here is decided by the canon's sorting test: does it need a date?
Then it is an incident and belongs here — a rule does not, and belongs in
[`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md) with its one-sentence why.

Every entry opens with its date and says what happened, how it was diagnosed,
and the command that proves the finding, so the next reader can check it
instead of believing it.
